# This is a portfolio/demo build — no backend, no database. All data lives in
# the browser's localStorage, seeded with fake patients/agenda/financeiro on
# first load (see src/blink/demoClient.ts). Nothing below is required to run it.

# Optional — only needed for the Google Calendar sync. Without it the rest of
# the app works normally; the "Conectar Google Calendar" button just won't do
# anything. See CLAUDE.md "Google Calendar sync" for how to get a client ID.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=SEU_CLIENT_ID_AQUI.apps.googleusercontent.com
